1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,210
Your Meet to Manage account is ready.
Here's a quick tour of everything inside.

2
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:12,530
One login, eight role-based portals — pick
yours, and your workspace opens instantly.

3
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:25,770
As an admin, enrollment, revenue and
attendance update in real time, right on
your dashboard. Turn any of it into a
report and export it as CSV in seconds.

4
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:35,710
As a teacher, your classes, attendance and
payouts are all one click away. Catch up
on past sessions anytime from your
recordings library.

5
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:47,420
Step into the live classroom itself —
video, whiteboard and quizzes, together in
one tab. Reactions, hand-raises and a live
leaderboard keep every student engaged.

6
00:00:49,520 --> 00:01:00,510
As a student, every class becomes
interactive — badges, quizzes and progress
you can see. Join a live class or catch
the recording later, whichever fits your
day.

7
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:11,390
As a parent, your child's schedule,
payments and class recordings live in one
dashboard. Add another child, or get
notified the moment a new invoice is due.

8
00:01:11,990 --> 00:01:23,200
Coordinators plan sessions, teacher
availability and batches from a single
shared calendar. Drag a session to a new
slot, and every calendar updates with it.

9
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:34,860
The admission team follows every lead from
first demo to enrollment, without leaving
the portal. Schedule the demo, assign the
teacher, and track conversion, all from
one queue.

10
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:46,040
Relationship managers get permission-
scoped access — exactly what your role
allows, nothing more. Every action they
take is logged automatically to the audit
trail.

11
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:59,540
Leadership sees revenue, performance and
reports roll up automatically, with no
separate spreadsheet. Compare this month
against last, and spot the trend before it
becomes a problem.

12
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:05,540
Eight portals. One system. Every screen
you just saw shares the same live data.

13
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:12,540
Meet to Manage — your account is set up.
Sign in, and pick up right where your role
starts.
